	(text "TELEM2 <-> Pi UART0: MAVLink2 921600 8N1, no flow control (BRD_SER2_RTSCTS=0).  VCC pin not connected.\nESC: DShot600 on FMU AUX1-4 (SERVO9-12; IO MAIN outputs do not do DShot).  Servo: AUX5 = SERVO13 PWM.\nRC: FS-iA6B iBUS -> RC IN (if not decoded, move to a spare UART with SERIALx_PROTOCOL=23).\nTELEM1: optical flow + ToF (MSP, 115200) for GPS-free Loiter in the gallery.\nFailsafes: RC + GCS loss -> brake/hold -> land; battery 2-stage (BATT_LOW/CRT); props idle when perched." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 210.82 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5734e813-c7af-4816-ba57-05b648254e2b"))
