	(label "BEAM_OUT" (at 434.34 311.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a412b701-6c8e-404d-87f9-8421141d05dd"))
	(text "IR: 2 strings x (2 x 850 nm 1 W LED + 4.7R) = 2 x ~0.37 A from 5 V (Vf ~1.6 V each); Q1 low-side, PWM dimmable on GPIO12.\nPump: 370-class diaphragm pump, ~0.3 A at 5 V, low-side Q2 + SS14 flyback; GPIO13 PWM sets sample flow.\nGate network: 100R series (edge/ringing) + 100k pull-down = load OFF while the Pi boots or is unpowered.\nAO3400A: logic-level (Vgs(th) <= 1.45 V, Rds(on) ~ 40-50 mOhm at 2.5-4.5 V), 30 V / 5.7 A.\nBreak-beam receiver is open-collector: pulled up to the Pi 3V3 (R1) so 5 V never reaches GPIO17." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 210.82 360.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "35f61a92-c4b6-4809-8faa-eb7ec71b786f"))
	(rectangle (start 474.98 248.92) (end 579.12 367.03) (stroke (width 0.35) (type dash) (color 217 119 6 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "f04a67ea-5c43-4f32-950b-c04f1337ec48"))
	(text "N. Wiring rules" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 477.52 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7b68ee80-cd5b-43c4-9a3b-f4e08c00675f"))
	(text "All logic is 3.3 V: FC UARTs, Pi GPIO,\nLiDAR Tx, ESP32-C3. No level shifters.\nSingle-point ground at the PM; signal\nharnesses carry their own GND wire.\n\nWire gauges: battery/PM/ESC 12 AWG;\nfused branches 20 AWG; signals 26-28 AWG.\n\nCurrent envelope: hover ~25 A (calc),\nPM02 60 A cont./100 A burst -> cap total\nat 80 A with MOT_BAT_CURR_MAX (amber).\n\nRadios: 2.4 GHz RC + ESP-NOW-LR share\nthe band - keep RC on high channel hop\nand the scout on Wi-Fi ch 1/6/11 plan.\nLoRa 865-867 MHz, PA_BOOST <= +17 dBm.\n\nNot built; values are design targets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 477.52 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c14cf0d2-4462-47d5-88b6-288ac3e28a83"))
